; claude: MPEG audio, decoded by our own code: MP2 (Layer2) and MP3
; (Layer3), their frames (Mpeg_audio_header) and the filterbank they
; end with (Polyphase), read with compression's Bits and Vlc. Pure
; OCaml. A private library, installed as part of elm_playground.
(library
 (name audio_mpeg)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries audio_signal compression)
)
